Sample 3D model

Samples/Models/Monkey.obj is "Suzanne", the monkey head built into Blender as
a mesh primitive (Add > Mesh > Monkey). It was generated with Blender 5.2
(subdivided and UV-mapped) and exported to OBJ for this package; no external
model file was downloaded. Blender itself is GPL software, but works created
with Blender, including its built-in primitives, are not covered by the GPL
and belong to the person who created them
(see https://www.blender.org/about/license/). The model is distributed with
this package under the same MIT License above.
